---@field month? number If specified, only return results for a single month. The value of `month` is an integer between `1` and `12`. If no year is specified the default `year` is used.
---@field day? number If specified, only return results for a single day. The value of `day` is an integer between `1` and `31`. If no `year` or `month` is specified, the default `year` and `month` are used.

